[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304F\u30FC\u3063\u3001\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3002\n\u5E2B\u5320\u306E\u8A71\u3001\u6CE3\u3051\u308B\u3058\u3083\u306D\u3048\u304B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man, that was touching... The master\u0027s story got me all choked up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4EBA\u306B\u6B74\u53F2\u3042\u308A\u3001\u3060\u306D\u3002\n\u307F\u3093\u306A\u305D\u308C\u305E\u308C\u306B\u5927\u4E8B\u306A\u904E\u53BB\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3082\u306E\u3055",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone has their own story to tell. And with those stories come memories they hold dear."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3054\u304D\u3052\u3093\u3088\u3046\u3002\u697D\u3057\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308B\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3067\u4F55\u3088\u308A\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good day, everyone. I\u0027m pleased to see you\u0027re all enjoying yourselves."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9\u304B\u3002\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306E\u305D\u3070\u306B\u3044\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3044\u3044\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara? Are you sure it\u0027s alright to be away from Diona?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u3082\u3046\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u306E\u5F79\u76EE\u306F\u7D42\u308F\u308A\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3001\u305D\u308D\u305D\u308D\u30AF\u30E9\u30A4\u30DE\u30C3\u30AF\u30B9\u3067\u3059\u3082\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, quite. My role is finished now. Besides, we\u0027re approaching the grand finale..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u82B1\u304C\u4E00\u756A\u7F8E\u3057\u304F\u54B2\u304F\u77AC\u9593\u3092\u3001\n\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u3082\u3053\u3061\u3089\u5074\u3067\u898B\u305F\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027d like to witness the moment when the flower blooms most beautifully from this side."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u304A\u30FC\uFF01\u3000\u3044\u3088\u3044\u3088\u306A\u3093\u3060\u306D\uFF01\n\u30D3\u30FC\u30C3\u30B0\u306A\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u305F\u3093\u3001\u697D\u3057\u307F\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ohhh! It\u0027s finally time! Can\u0027t wait to see our big Dio in action!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8272\u3005\u8D64\u88F8\u3005\u306B\u79C1\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8A9E\u3089\u308C\u305F\u304C\u2026\u2026\n\u6700\u5F8C\u306B\u4F55\u3092\u6B4C\u3046\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u3060\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She\u0027s revealed quite a lot about me... What could she possibly be planning to sing about now?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3092\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u805E\u304F\u3093\u3060\u3002\n\u304D\u3063\u3068\u3001\u3059\u3079\u3066\u610F\u5473\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306F\u305A\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s what we\u0027re about to find out. I\u0027m sure there\u0027s meaning behind all of this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u65E5\u3005\u306E\u8077\u52D9\u306B\u61F8\u547D\u3067\u3042\u308A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...One who devotedly fulfills their duties,"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u611B\u3057\u304D\u3082\u306E\u3092\u304B\u308F\u3044\u304C\u308A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who cherishes those they hold dear,"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5BB6\u65CF\u3092\u60F3\u3044\u5E78\u305B\u3092\u9858\u3044\u3001\u4EA1\u304D\u5927\u5207\u306A\u8005\u3092\u5072\u3076\u8005",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who wishes happiness for their family, and honors those who have passed..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2015\u2015\u3053\u308C\u304C\u300E\u771F\u306A\u308B\u82F1\u96C4\u300F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\u2014This is what makes a \u0027True Hero.\u0027"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6570\u3005\u306E\u7ADC\u3092\u8A0E\u3061\u3001\u5F37\u304F\u901E\u3057\u304D\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u3002\n\u30E9\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CA\u306E\u82F1\u96C4",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Knight of the Midnight Sun, who has vanquished many dragons. Lantarna\u0027s hero."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u60F3\u3044\u306F\u3001\u884C\u52D5\u306F\u3001\u6211\u3089\u3068\u306A\u3093\u3089\u5909\u308F\u3089\u306C\u3082\u306E\u3002\n\u6C7A\u3057\u3066\u9060\u3044\u5B58\u5728\u306B\u975E\u305A\u3002\u540C\u3058\u4EF2\u9593\u3001\u4E00\u4EBA\u306E\u4EBA\u9593",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Their feelings, their actions, are no different from our own. Not a distant figure, but one of us\u2014a fellow human being."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u3042\u3001\u4EBA\u3005\u3088\uFF01\u3000\u596E\u3044\u7ACB\u3066\uFF01\n\u306A\u3089\u3070\u6211\u3089\u3082\u4E00\u6B69\u8E0F\u307F\u51FA\u305B\u3070",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, rise up, everyone! If we take that first step forward..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7686\u304C\u8AB0\u304B\u306E\u82F1\u96C4\u2015\u2015",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can all be someone\u0027s hero\u2014"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u304A\u304A\u304A\uFF01\uFF01\uFF01\u3000\u826F\u304B\u3063\u305F\u305E\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\uFF01\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "YEAHHH!!! That was amazing, Diona!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u7537\u6027",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3046\u4E00\u66F2\u805E\u304B\u305B\u3066\u30FC\uFF01\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Encore! Encore!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u5973\u6027",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Woman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5F37\u304F\u901E\u3057\u304F\u3001\u5DF1\u3092\u53B3\u3057\u304F\u5F8B\u3059\u308B\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u30E6\u30CA\u3002\n\u3000\u7686\u5C0A\u656C\u306E\u5FF5\u3092\u62B1\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3060\u308D\u3046\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Juna, the strong and disciplined Knight of the Midnight Sun... Everyone must look up to her with such respect.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u305D\u306E\u60F3\u3044\u306F\u5F7C\u5973\u3092\u4EBA\u304B\u3089\u9060\u3056\u3051\u308B\u3002\n\u3000\u5F7C\u5973\u306F\u81EA\u5206\u305F\u3061\u3068\u306F\u9055\u3046\u5B58\u5728\u306A\u306E\u3060\u3068\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But that admiration creates distance. It makes them think she\u0027s different from us.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3060\u304C\u305D\u3046\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3001\u518D\u3073\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3068\u51FA\u4F1A\u3044\n\u3000\u884C\u52D5\u3092\u5171\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3046\u3061\u306B\u79C1\u306F\u6C17\u304C\u4ED8\u3044\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But that\u0027s not true\u2014I realized it after meeting Juna again and working alongside her.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u4F1D\u308F\u3063\u305F\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304B\u3002\u4F1D\u308F\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3044\u306A\u3002\n\u3000\u3053\u306E\u6B4C\u306B\u8FBC\u3081\u305F\u79C1\u306E\u60F3\u3044\u304C\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I wonder if it got through to them. I hope they understood the feelings I put into this song.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3060\u3063\u305F\uFF1F\u3000\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306E\u6B4C\u306F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well? What did you think of Diona\u0027s song?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u79C1\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306E\u6B4C\u3060\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u307E\u3063\u305F\u304F\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3067\u306F\u6012\u308B\u306B\u6012\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...So that song was for me. Really now, how can I possibly be angry about this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u7D20\u6674\u3089\u3057\u3044\u6B4C\u3067\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It truly was a wonderful song."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]